# 14. Payload Detection

Blue Teams may detect payload activity through:

### File telemetry

- File creation
- File hash
- File type
- Digital signature

### Process telemetry

- Process creation
- Parent-child relationship
- Command line
- Loaded modules

### Network telemetry

- Connections
- DNS requests
- Destination reputation
- Connection timing

